# Summary

The handbook states that vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook [[cite:obs-0365be3413f4fb9b519021b410e1780f746a2a77 "Vehicles of members are parked according to the plan in the appendix of this handbook."]].

The appendix specifies that bays twelve through thirty are blocked, reserved for supplier vans only, with a midday deadline [[cite:obs-9f20ae0fa0e7cac77b1fda9cb1b5aaa637994849 "Bays twelve through thirty: blocked, supplier vans only, midday deadline."]].

This indicates that these parking spaces are reserved and have a time limit for parking.
